Schematic.to_svg() left these out entirely. The SVG arc flags of KiCad's
start/mid/end arcs are now worked out by kicad_arc_svg_flags(), which
symbol arcs use as well.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_013wvKon1yvwjNtAdtSuZzZh
